SLICC / gem5 Ruby Language Support for VS Code

Author: chengxin

This implementation was developed by studying the user's local
SLICC / gem5 Ruby Language Plugin for CLion / IntelliJ IDEA, through version 1.6.0,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Original repository: https://github.com/ilo5u/gem5-slicc-plugin

The VS Code source model and editor integration are an independent JavaScript
implementation of that plugin's language rules and editor behavior.

The 16 SLICC file and declaration SVG icons in icons/ are reused from the
original plugin's src/main/resources/icons/ directory under that license.

gem5 protocol and C++ files used by the optional reference-corpus verification
retain their original licenses and are not distributed in this extension.
